# Written by tests/mutation-engine.js on every run and read by
# tests/probes/assertion-coverage.js. Deliberately NOT committed: it is the
# result of one ~30-minute run against one build, so a committed copy would be
# stale within a commit and would answer "which assertions are proven" about a
# version of the product that no longer exists. Anyone can regenerate it, and
# the probe says so when it is missing.
tests/.mutation-journal.json
